msgstr "Suuqayada xorta ah ee caalamiga ah: baadh in ka badan 10,000 oo adeegyo diyaarsan oo ka yimid qorayaal, nashqadeeyayaal, sameeyayaal barnaamijyo iyo khubarada SEO, ama dheji mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalab ku soo gudbiyaan."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-prompt.php:211
msgid "The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again."
msgstr "Furaha API waa la diiday. Hubi inuu wali shaqaynayo oo uu leeyahay oggolaanshaha tarjumaadda, ka dibna mar kale kaydi."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-prompt.php:218
msgid "The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them."
msgstr "Bixiyuhu wuxuu ku diiday qaansheegta ama kootada awgeed. Waxba lama turjumin. Hubi hadhaaga iyo xaddidaadaha koontadaada ee xaggooda."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-prompt.php:225
msgid "The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass."
msgstr "Bixiyaha tarjumaadda ayaa dhibaato kala kulmaya dhankooda. Waxba lama tarjamin lamana qaadin, waxaana mar kale la isku dayi doonaa wareegga xiga."

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-prompt.php:231
msgid "The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Codsiga turjumaaddu wuu fashilmay mana aannu ogaan karin sababta. Waxba lama kaydin."

