msgid "DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass."
msgstr "Lama xiriiri karin DeepL. Waxba lama tarjumin wax kharash ahna lama qaadin; waxay mar kale isku dayi doontaa wareegga xiga."

