msgstr "Boggan kuma xidhna Zinn Digital®, markaa ma jiraan wax la ururiyo. Ku dar Aqoonsiga Goobta iyo calaamadda (token), ama u beddel furahaaga bixiyaha."

#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-zinn.php:135
#: includes/providers/class-zinn-translate-provider-zinn.php:251
